<title>UK: Marine Tech Ltd sets $71.5 mln equity warrant bond.</title>
<headline>Marine Tech Ltd sets $71.5 mln equity warrant bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following equity-linked issue was announced by lead manager Tokyo-Mitsubishi International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MARINE TECH LTD</p>
<p> AMT	  $71.5 MLN COUPON     2.625     MATURITY    18.OCT.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 WARRANTS  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    18.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.25	IND PREM   2.50 PCT</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10	SALE LIMITS JP/UK/US/KY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.50     PRAECIPUUM  0.25</p>
<p> NOTES	TWO WARRANTS PER BOND FOR SHARES IN COMMON STOCK OF</p>
<p>		ZUKEN INC.  PRICING ON 09.OCT.96.  REFIX</p>
<p>		CLAUSE AFTER ONE YEAR TO A FLOOR OF 80.0 PCT OF THE</p>
<p>		ORIGINAL EXERCISE PRICE.</p>
<p>		EXERCISE PERIOD   - 01.NOV.96-04.OCT.99</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
